# Interim (until plademy.com DNS → AWS edge-1): the header/footer link to pages the
# Ekosistem Next app serves on plademy.com. While Netlify still answers plademy.com,
# send them to the same pages on ecosystem.page. After the cutover these paths never
# reach Netlify (the Next middleware only proxies content paths), so this is inert.
/pricing                 https://ecosystem.page/pricing                 302
/trial                   https://ecosystem.page/trial                   302
/terms                   https://ecosystem.page/terms                   302
/community-guidelines    https://ecosystem.page/community-guidelines    302
/auth/*                  https://ecosystem.page/auth/:splat             302
/use-cases/*             https://ecosystem.page/use-cases/:splat        302
/mentorship/*            https://ecosystem.page/mentorship/:splat       302
/features/*              https://ecosystem.page/features/:splat         302
/security                https://ecosystem.page/security                302
/security/*              https://ecosystem.page/security/:splat         302
/support                 https://ecosystem.page/support                 302
/support/*               https://ecosystem.page/support/:splat          302
